        "backstory": {
          "v": "Raschelverdacht guards the quietest HyperNorm stairwell with a spear he finds reassuringly substantial. Silence is safe or suspicious, depending on the preceding sound. A card allowing uncertainty makes both categories tremble. Men in Black expect vigilance, so he reports the rustle before checking whether it came from his own scarf.",
