        "backstory": {
          "v": "Bummbert supplies the HyperNorm residents with a shared beat before asking whether they want one. A card proposing that solidarity can tolerate different rhythms receives another tremendous opening flourish. Hunky & Dory encourage participation. He is delighted whenever somebody joins in, and has difficulty distinguishing that event from somebody asking him to stop.",
