        "backstory": {
          "v": "Kantenruhe rests a hand on her broad stone hatchet while the HyperNorm corridor meeting revisits its opening motion. A disagreement is finished or unnecessary, according to her private rule. A card suggesting that patience may contain resistance stays near her door. Men in Black read her silence as cooperation; she has not confirmed their reading.",
